    "text_zh": "",
    "text_pt": "",
    "text_en": "In this Act:ADI means an authorised deposit ‑ taking institution within the meaning of the Banking Act 1959 .\nPacific banking guarantee has the meaning given by subsection 5(2).\nPacific region includes:\n(a) the islands of the Pacific; and\n(b) Papua New Guinea; and\n(c) Timor ‑ Leste.",
    "text_original_language": "en",
